  "critique": {
    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-forensic art direction, dramatic headline hierarchy, restrained cyan/red palette, consistent card styling, and crisp typography. Desktop is polished but leaves excessive dead space beneath the main composition. Tablet feels vertically stretched with loosely connected cards and large empty gaps. Mobile loses the visual connector narrative entirely, becomes a long stack, and the header drops the brand name while visibly truncating navigation. Several muted labels are also extremely small and low-emphasis.",
    "fix": "Tighten desktop section height, compress tablet spacing, and preserve a simplified visible flow/connector treatment on mobile. Keep the mobile brand lockup, add a clearer navigation affordance, and increase the size or contrast of muted micro-labels.",
